  <ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase" ADogSaidBody="LegsTail">
    <defName>RSW_Behemoth</defName>
    <label>behemoth</label>
    <description>The Behemoths (or 'Sith war behemoths') were beasts of war used by the Sith that originated from the frozen planet Khar Dhelba. Wild war behemoths tended to travel in small groups of two to four and spent most of their existence searching for food. They were omnivorous in the sense that they ate anything they were able to find. The Behemoths were spread to various worlds with the Sith armies, either escaping or let loose  whehre they would revert back to their original feral forms.</description>
